// Title: Binary Proxy Execution Via Dotnet-Trace.EXE
// Rule ID: 9257c05b-4a4a-48e5-a670-b7b073cf401b
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1218
// Category: process_creation
